Relationship to Claude Code
---------------------------

tabard does not bundle, modify, or redistribute Claude Code. It requires Claude
Code to be installed separately, and works only by setting the documented
CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR environment variable and launching the `claude` executable
already on your PATH.

tabard does not read, store, transmit, or proxy authentication tokens. It reads
token expiry and subscription type from a profile's credentials file purely to
label rows in the profile picker; the token values themselves are never accessed.

tabard is intended for one person managing their own accounts — for example a
personal account and a work account. It is not a means of sharing a subscription,
pooling accounts, or working around usage limits, all of which violate Anthropic's
terms of service.
